            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "ofedaisy"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Keeper but made a few twists to the dressing: added a whole clove of minced garlic and a heaping teaspoon of ginger paste and topped it off with sesame seeds. Paired great with the salad. Delish!",
            "datePublished": "2016-11-16T16:14:40.610Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
